OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas disruption as railway
OL,4,Abridge replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers on the West Coast Main
OL,7,FLine are being warned of significant
OL,8,Fdisruption over the Christmas period.
OL,10,FNetwork Rail engineers will replace the
OL,11,Fdeck of the bridge that runs over the
OL,12,FRiver Nene at Long Buckby in
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire at a cost of #9.3m.
OL,15,FIt means no trains will run between
OL,16,FNorthampton and Rugby via Long Buckby
OL,17,Fbetween Sunday 27 December and Friday 1
OL,18,FJanuary, with replacement buses in
OL,19,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
